  {
   "name": "gui-items",
   "do": "shot",
   "look": "items in GUI slots, row 1: wood/stone-fluid/gold-power/diamond/structure pipes, oak facade, stone-brick facade, iron gate, gold gate; row 2: red lens, clear filter, blocker, pulsar, light sensor, timer, power adaptor, robot, docking station; row 3: wrench, lava/light-fuel/oil/water shards, volume and path marker, gate copier, paintbrush. Compare shading and icons 26.3 vs 26.2"
  },
